Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:05.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝正试图破坏66个封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith is trying to break the 66 seals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.84,0:00:07.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从地狱解放路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}To free lucifer from hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.47,0:00:08.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你是谁?  -卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.81,0:00:09.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是上帝的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an angel of the lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.87,0:00:11.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜  你没事吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna,you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.41,0:00:12.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想起我的身份了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember now who i am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.91,0:00:14.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是一个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.48,0:00:22.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跑不了的...迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't run...dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.79,0:00:23.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿拉斯泰尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alastair.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:26.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位是尤利尔  一位专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is uriel,a specialist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.46,0:00:28.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帕梅拉·巴恩斯  全国最好的灵媒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pamela barnes,best damn psychic in the state.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.70,0:00:31.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帕梅拉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pamela!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.93,0:00:34.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他把我放下拷问台  之后我开始折磨其他灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took me off the rack,and i tortured souls,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.30,0:00:35.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而那时我很享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}And i liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:37.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管我拯救了多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter how many people i save,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:39.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都无法弥补这罪孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't fill this hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.80,0:00:42.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的问题不在于什么超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the psychic thing i got a problem with.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.57,0:00:44.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你的问题在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,i know what you got a problem with,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.71,0:00:45.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过这很难\N{\fnArial\fs30}But tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.98,0:00:47.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-但却是唯一的办法  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way. no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.91,0:00:50.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你对那个恶魔做了什么  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you did to that demon,sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.95,0:00:54.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帕梅拉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pamela!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.57,0:01:47.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永别了  我的姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye,sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.96,0:02:09.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么飞机?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.96,0:02:47.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,露比会在怀俄明的夏延城和我们碰面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby will meet us outside cheyenne.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.33,0:02:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她一直在追踪那几条线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been tracking some leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.47,0:02:51.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我知道你不喜欢她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,i know she's not exactly on your christmas list,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.70,0:02:53.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但她能帮我们找到莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if she can help us get to lilith --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.30,0:02:56.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老弟  我才不在乎和露比一起共事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man,work with ruby,don't. i don't really give a rat's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.67,0:02:57.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你怎么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.01,0:02:59.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帕梅拉本不想牵涉进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pamela didn't want anything to do with this,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.01,0:03:02.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我们连累了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we dragged her back into it,sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.28,0:03:03.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她清楚这是存亡攸关的大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knew what was at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.81,0:03:05.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,yeah,saving the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.18,0:03:07.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我们真他妈干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're doing such a damn good job of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.42,0:03:08.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean --
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.52,0:03:10.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不想埋葬伙伴了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired of burying friends,sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.89,0:03:13.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  如果我们抓到一条新线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,if we catch a fresh trail --
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.76,0:03:16.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就追踪下去  我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}We follow it. i know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.86,0:03:18.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我说了  我只是厌倦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like i said,i'm just -- i'm just getting tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.90,0:03:20.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,化悲痛为动力吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,get angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.34,0:03:28.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回家真"好"啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home,crappy home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.44,0:03:33.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温彻斯特兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchester and winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.48,0:03:34.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是真的吧!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.98,0:03:36.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.25,0:03:37.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮忙?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Needed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.61,0:03:39.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚忙完回来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just got back from needed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.35,0:03:41.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我说话时放尊重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now,you mind your tone with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.25,0:03:42.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  是你该放尊重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,you mind your damn tone with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.05,0:03:45.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚从帕梅拉的葬礼上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just got back from pamela's funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.69,0:03:47.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帕梅拉  知道吗  那个通灵师?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pamela -- you know,psychic pamela?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.86,0:03:49.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得她吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.19,0:03:52.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西  你应该记得  你灼瞎了她的双眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass,you remember her. you burned her eyes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.53,0:03:54.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得吗?  真是欢乐啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that? good times!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.70,0:03:57.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后她为了保护其中一个该死的封印而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,then she died saving one of your precious seals.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.04,0:04:00.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们能不能别再当我们小卒乱耍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,maybe you can stop pushing us around like chess pieces
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.54,0:04:02.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪怕一会儿也好!\N{\fnArial\fs30}For five freakin' minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.41,0:04:05.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把你救出地狱自有目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We raised you out of hell for our purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.34,0:04:07.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  什么目的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,and what were those again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.28,0:04:08.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们到底想要我做什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.05,0:04:11.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你态度好些再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start with gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.85,0:04:14.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我们明白这很难接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean,we know this is difficult to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.48,0:04:16.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.49,0:04:21.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}...don't...care.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.83,0:04:28.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  已有7名天使被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now,seven angels have been murdered --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.73,0:04:30.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都是我们的精英\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them from our garrison.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.53,0:04:32.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚又有一名天使被害\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last one was killed tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.47,0:04:33.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是恶魔干的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.97,0:04:36.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们怎么做到的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How they doing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.61,0:04:38.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.11,0:04:39.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思  就这件事我们能做什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry,but what do you want us to do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:41.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个可以杀死天使的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,a demon with the juice to ice angels
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.71,0:04:43.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们对他也无能为力吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has to be out of our league,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.41,0:04:45.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能对付恶魔  不用你操心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can handle the demons,thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.58,0:04:48.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前提是我们要找到它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we find whoever it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:53.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你要我们帮忙...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,you need our help...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.69,0:04:55.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,追捕恶魔吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunting a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.46,0:04:57.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不算是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.73,0:05:00.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们抓到了阿拉斯泰尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have alastair. great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.43,0:05:02.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会告诉你们该找谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He should be able to name your triggerman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.63,0:05:04.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他不肯说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he won't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.30,0:05:06.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿拉斯泰尔的意志非常强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alastair's will is very strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.60,0:05:08.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的审讯陷入僵局\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've arrived at an impasse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.71,0:05:10.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  他可是拷问的专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,well,he's like a black belt in torture.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.71,0:05:12.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的水平和他不能相提并论\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,you guys are out of your league.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.48,0:05:14.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是为什么我们来找他的高徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we've come to his student.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.38,0:05:16.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你恰好是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You happen to be
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.65,0:05:21.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们拥有的最称职的判官\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most qualified interrogator we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.75,0:05:23.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:25.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我们最大的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're our best hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.39,0:05:27.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.42,0:05:28.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没门\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:31.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能要求我做这种事  卡西  不要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't ask me to do this,cass -- not this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.30,0:05:41.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁说过...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who said anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.54,0:05:43.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是要求你了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}about asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:49.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.85,0:05:58.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个恶魔陷阱是古老的魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}This devil's trap is old enochian.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.56,0:06:01.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他完全被束缚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's bound completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.50,0:06:06.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,精彩极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.64,0:06:07.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,门在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.04,0:06:09.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.38,0:06:12.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去搭我的雪弗兰  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hitch back to Cheyenne,thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.45,0:06:17.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使们在垂死挣扎  小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels are dying,boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.35,0:06:19.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些天每个人都在垂死挣扎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody's dying these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.75,0:06:21.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以让我做任何你要求事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can make me do whatever you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.22,0:06:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你不能让我做这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you can't make me do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.04,0:06:27.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道要求你做这种事很难\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is too much to ask. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.70,0:06:29.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们必须要求你做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we have to ask it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.75,0:06:39.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我单独和卡西聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to talk to Cass alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.59,0:06:46.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我想我可以去找找\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'll go seek...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.49,0:06:47.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,启示录\N{\fnArial\fs30}revelation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.60,0:06:51.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也许会有更进一步的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might have some further orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.17,0:06:54.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出去的时候带两个甜甜圈回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,get some doughnuts while you're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.14,0:07:00.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子就是不认输  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah,this one just won't quit,will he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.01,0:07:03.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我开始喜欢你了  小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm starting to like you,boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.12,0:07:10.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这帮人走路太少  你们会变成病夫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys don't walk enough. You're gonna get flabby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.13,0:07:13.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  我开始想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,I'm starting to think
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.79,0:07:16.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都比你们有幽默感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Junkless has a better sense of humor than you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.20,0:07:19.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤利尔是天使卫队里最幽默的天使了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uriel's the funniest angel in the garrison.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:20.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便你去问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.17,0:07:26.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么了  卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on,cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.54,0:07:31.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候开始让尤利尔牵着你的鼻子走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when does Uriel put a leash on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.08,0:07:34.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的上司开始质疑我的同情心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My superiors have begun to question my sympathies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.41,0:07:34.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的上司?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sympathies?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.85,0:07:37.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和我管辖下的人类走得太近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was getting too close to the humans in my charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.19,0:07:38.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.90,0:07:42.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们认为我开始感情用事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They feel I've begun to express emotions,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.40,0:07:44.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走上质疑上帝之路\N{\fnArial\fs30}the doorways to doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.44,0:07:45.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这会削弱我的判断力\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can impair my judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.00,0:07:51.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就告诉尤利尔或是其他什么人...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,tell Uriel or whoever...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.38,0:07:57.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不想让我做这事儿  相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}...you do not want me doing this,trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.58,0:08:00.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不想让你做?  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want it? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.95,0:08:02.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我被告知我们需要你做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've been told we need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:08.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要我打开那扇门走过去...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ask me to open that door and walk through it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.96,0:08:11.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会喜欢走回来的那个我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will not like what walks back out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.96,0:08:17.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果那是值得的话...\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what it's worth...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.26,0:08:19.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我愿放弃一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would give anything
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.13,0:08:21.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你不必做这事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}not to have you do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.59,0:08:41.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.76,0:08:43.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我进天堂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in heaven ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.99,0:08:50.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的心太激动以至于口不能言\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my heart beats so that I can hardly speak
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.20,0:08:54.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我仿佛找到了我的幸福之源\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seem to find the happiness I seek
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.93,0:08:58.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我们一起出去跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we're out together dancing
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.10,0:09:00.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四目相对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheek to cheek.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.88,0:09:12.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.52,0:09:14.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.72,0:09:21.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对你来说这是个极具戏剧性的重要时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a very serious,very emotional situation for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.26,0:09:22.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真不应该笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.03,0:09:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我意思是说这事儿他们是认真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that,I mean,are they serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.87,0:09:32.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们让你来折磨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They sent you to torture me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.44,0:09:34.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只有一个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got one chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.91,0:09:36.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.31,0:09:38.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁在猎杀天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me who is killing the angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.78,0:09:40.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要他的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.65,0:09:44.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为我看了你这些吓人的小玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'll see all your scary toys
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.65,0:09:46.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就会招供了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and spill my guts?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.72,0:09:50.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你总会招的  总有一个办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,you'll spill your guts,one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.82,0:09:52.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是不想弄脏我的鞋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just didn't want to ruin my shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.73,0:09:54.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.93,0:09:56.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在回答我的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.50,0:09:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然呢  你要玩儿死我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what? you'll work me over?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.20,0:10:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  也许...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then,maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.17,0:10:05.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你并不想那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.91,0:10:08.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.51,0:10:13.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的恐惧之源\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're a-scared to ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.28,0:10:15.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就在这里  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here,aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.22,0:10:16.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不完整的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.45,0:10:18.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一部分的你留在了地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left part of yourself back in the pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.72,0:10:21.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看我们是否能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see if we can...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.79,0:10:25.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮你找回另一半  怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the two of you back together again,shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.40,0:10:30.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会失望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.23,0:10:34.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没让我失望过呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have not disappointed me so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.30,0:10:36.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.80,0:10:39.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对你做了那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to want a little payback
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.24,0:10:41.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你总想要点补偿的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}For everything I did to you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.91,0:10:46.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你遍体鳞伤的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all the pokes and prods.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.68,0:10:50.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.82,0:10:52.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.45,0:10:56.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说说我对你老爸做的事怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about for all the things I did to your daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.96,0:11:05.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还能闻到他们的气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can still smell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.77,0:11:08.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实在的  萨姆  我又不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously,Sam,I'm not exactly dying
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.84,0:11:10.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不和天使纠缠不清就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}to tangle with angels again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.54,0:11:12.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你查出他们把迪恩带去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to find out where they took dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.01,0:11:15.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不太明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sure I see the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.81,0:11:16.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他们抓住了阿拉斯泰尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know they have Alastair
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.93,0:11:18.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用六芒星困住了阿拉斯泰尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}strung up six ways from sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.01,0:11:21.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩很了解他自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean cuts himself a slice,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.55,0:11:22.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿尔也已虎落平阳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Al's reduced to a quivering heap,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.92,0:11:23.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人人都会满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the good guys get the goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.05,0:11:25.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这又有什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.15,0:11:26.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.75,0:11:27.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.05,0:11:30.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不想让他再去拷问别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want him going all torture master again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.19,0:11:31.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我是说  他办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,I mean,he can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.96,0:11:33.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他完成不了这个任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't get the job done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:36.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在地狱里他经历了很多事  露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something happened to him downstairs,Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.26,0:11:39.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不是以前的他了  他还不够强\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not what he used to be. he's not strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.20,0:11:40.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.93,0:11:44.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会变强的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.27,0:11:47.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸爸被绑在刑架上差不多有一世纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had your pop on my rack for close to a century.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.64,0:11:49.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再拖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't stall forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.41,0:11:51.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰·温彻斯特  名字起的真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Winchester -- made quite a name for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.05,0:11:53.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一百年啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.51,0:11:55.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次用完刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after each session,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.62,0:11:58.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都向他提出和你一样的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd make him the same offer I made you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.02,0:12:02.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要他接受  我就会停手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd put down my blade if he picked one up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.52,0:12:05.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说出那个恶魔的名字吧  阿拉斯泰尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me the demon's name,Alastair.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.73,0:12:07.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.39,0:12:08.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说  休想\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said,"nein"...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.90,0:12:11.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次次都这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}...each and every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.77,0:12:16.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不向我妥协\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damned if I couldn't break him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.64,0:12:18.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就用尽办法折磨他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulled out all the stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.87,0:12:23.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是约翰  他让有些事变得很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}But John,he was... made of something unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.44,0:12:26.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,英雄事迹啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stuff of heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.28,0:12:29.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后迪恩来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then came Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.08,0:12:31.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm,Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.49,0:12:34.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为我又碰上对手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I was up against it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.49,0:12:38.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是爸爸的乖女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But daddy's little girl --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.19,0:12:40.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他妥协了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He broked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.79,0:12:44.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他三十年就妥协了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He broked in 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.43,0:12:50.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸不希望你成为这种人吧  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just not the man your daddy wanted you to be,huh,Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.51,0:12:54.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.04,0:13:00.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们又重逢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we're getting somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.61,0:13:02.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy water?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.12,0:13:03.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.05,0:13:05.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鬼  想打动我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grasshopper,you're gonna have
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.40,0:13:08.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也得有点创意啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get creative to impress me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.46,0:13:09.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  阿拉斯泰尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know something,Alastair?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.39,0:13:14.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是在地狱里  我也还有梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could still dream,even in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.36,0:13:16.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一次又一次  你知道我梦想什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And over and over and over,you know what I dreamt?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.16,0:13:19.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是梦想着这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dreamt of this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.14,0:13:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And believe me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.44,0:13:28.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有办法让你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}...I got a few ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.56,0:13:52.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.80,0:14:21.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还想再要点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me know if you want some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.70,0:14:23.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还剩不少呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's plenty left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.50,0:14:27.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go directly to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.80,0:14:31.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不成功  便成仁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not pass go. do not collect $200.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.94,0:14:34.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Mihi pareas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.21,0:14:36.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ubicumque in occultatione sis,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.38,0:14:40.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Defigo te ut mihi pareas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.32,0:14:46.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Igni...fiat...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.72,0:14:48.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Notum.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.96,0:14:52.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别紧张  火是我们的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax. The fire is our friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.26,0:14:54.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说了  我们只需要一部分地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides,the only part of the map we need
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.46,0:14:56.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是"迪恩在哪里"的那部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the "where's dean" part.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.70,0:14:57.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.03,0:15:04.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在那  你哥哥就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. your brother is there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.21,0:15:05.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使们没把他们的肮脏交易藏着掖着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's a good thing angels aren't concerned
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.90,0:15:07.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是件好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}with hiding their dirty business.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.94,0:15:09.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没习惯被侦察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not used to being spied on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.31,0:15:12.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  谁会傻到去试这个啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,who'd be stupid enough to try?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.00,0:15:15.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,露比  好几个星期了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby,it's been weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.50,0:15:17.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.87,0:15:19.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好像不太高兴啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't seem too happy about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.87,0:15:21.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为我想这么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think i want to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.14,0:15:26.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我最不愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the last thing i --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.35,0:15:31.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我需要够强\N{\fnArial\fs30}But i need to be strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.89,0:15:39.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.66,0:15:42.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay,Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.46,0:15:44.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以拥有它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.02,0:16:11.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay,sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.20,0:16:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是小小恶魔刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's that little pig poker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.47,0:16:24.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还奇怪它到哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wondered where it went.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.34,0:16:33.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的以为这样可以拯救你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think this is gonna fix you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.74,0:16:36.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你一个终结吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give you closure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.55,0:16:41.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那太可悲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,that is sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.39,0:16:43.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可真可悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's really sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.42,0:16:45.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太可悲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sad,sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.97,0:17:05.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩 是我重新塑造了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...carved you into a n-new animal,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.08,0:17:11.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有回头路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no...going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.08,0:17:13.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.39,0:17:18.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在轮到我来塑造你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now it's my turn to carve.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.00,0:17:30.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁控制着凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's behind the murders?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.17,0:17:32.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要那个恶魔的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want the demon's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.45,0:17:45.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.42,0:17:46.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello,Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.49,0:17:51.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的人类身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your human body.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.06,0:17:56.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道它被破坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was destroyed. i know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.79,0:17:59.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.30,0:18:01.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我有点多情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess i'm sentimental.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.13,0:18:03.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想起了我以前得到一些帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Called in some old favors,and...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.44,0:18:09.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不应该来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.51,0:18:12.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们仍然有杀掉你的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still have orders to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.71,0:18:14.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知何故  我不认为你会那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow,i don't think you'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.28,0:18:17.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤利尔在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Uriel?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.98,0:18:20.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他去接受天启了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went to receive revelation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.72,0:18:23.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.07,0:18:47.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真敬佩你的职业精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,it's your professionalism that i respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.08,0:18:56.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要让迪恩这么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you letting Dean do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.53,0:19:03.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在做上帝的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's doing god's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.86,0:19:05.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,折磨他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Torturing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.63,0:19:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是上帝的工作吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's god's work?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.16,0:19:10.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥  住手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop him,Cass,please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.23,0:19:12.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你还没有毁掉自己真正的武器之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you ruin the one real weapon you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.87,0:19:16.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么能去质疑上帝的指令呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are we to question the will of god?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.14,0:19:19.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非这不是他的指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless... this isn't his will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.11,0:19:20.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那这些指令从哪里来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then where do the orders come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.81,0:19:24.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  可能是一个像我们一样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. one of our superiors maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.15,0:19:25.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但绝不是上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.62,0:19:32.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁在谋杀天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's murdering the angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.69,0:19:35.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个你爱的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}The father you love...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.03,0:19:38.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得他想要这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think he wants this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.20,0:19:40.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得他会叫你这么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think he'd ask this of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.30,0:19:43.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这是正义的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this is righteous?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.44,0:19:51.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you're feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.84,0:19:53.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫做怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.42,0:20:08.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些命令是错误的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These orders are wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.06,0:20:10.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.39,0:20:12.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你能做正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.26,0:20:14.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥  你害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're afraid,Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.63,0:20:15.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.90,0:20:18.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果我们一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}But together,we can --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.70,0:20:19.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.67,0:20:25.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和你没有共同点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am nothing like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.98,0:20:28.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你堕落过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.75,0:20:30.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.28,0:20:32.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.59,0:20:35.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.27,0:20:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不够强烈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just not getting deep enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.47,0:20:56.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你缺乏手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,you lack the resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.37,0:20:58.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reality is just...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.61,0:21:00.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.41,0:21:03.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,具体不能在这说\N{\fnArial\fs30}...too concrete up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.02,0:21:08.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly,Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.59,0:21:13.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不明白它有多糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea how bad it really was...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.92,0:21:16.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有你对我们做了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what you really did for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.20,0:21:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.36,0:21:22.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  最残酷的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole bloody thing,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.37,0:21:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝最想要你去那里的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reason Lilith wanted you there in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.37,0:21:27.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我就让你闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,then i'll just make you shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.70,0:21:53.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.40,0:21:56.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有东西堵住了我的喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something caught in my throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.90,0:22:01.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想是我的咽喉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's my throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.24,0:22:03.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,strap in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.64,0:22:05.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我才刚开始玩你\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I'm just starting to have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.05,0:22:13.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来应该是你父亲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was supposed to be your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.12,0:22:15.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来应该有他来开启的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was supposed to bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.95,0:22:19.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但最后  却是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in the end,it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.42,0:22:21.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开启什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring what on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.22,0:22:25.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每晚  那一成不变的条件  还记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every night,the same offer,remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.56,0:22:28.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对你父亲开得也是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same as your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.90,0:22:32.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而终究还是你松了口  接受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And finally you said,"sign me up."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.27,0:22:38.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得吗  你第一次拿起我的剃刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,the first time you picked up my razor,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.28,0:22:40.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first time
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.98,0:22:47.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用剃刀扎进那个泪流满面的小贱人的那一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sliced into that weeping bitch...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.55,0:22:50.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是第一道封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the first seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.96,0:23:02.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胡扯吧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.74,0:23:09.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古记写着  第一个封印打破之际\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and it is written that the first seal shall be broken
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.61,0:23:13.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是正义之士在地狱嗜血之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}"when a righteous man sheds blood in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.34,0:23:19.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的堕落  就是破印之源\N{\fnArial\fs30}As he breaks,so shall it break."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.66,0:23:31.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有打破了第一个封印  其他的才能被打破\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had to break the first seal before any others.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.90,0:23:35.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像是多米诺的原理一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only way to get the dominoes to fall right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.90,0:23:39.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要推到最前面的那个才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Topple the one at the front of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.48,0:23:48.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我们成功时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we win...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.78,0:23:51.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重开天启之际\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we bring on the apocalypse
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.95,0:23:55.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将地球变为炼狱那一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}And burn this earth down...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.25,0:23:58.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实这都拜你所赐\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll owe it all to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.89,0:24:01.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.90,0:24:12.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me,son.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.40,0:24:15.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没必要撒这种谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't lie about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.64,0:24:17.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可关乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.21,0:24:24.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直信奉的宗教信仰啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}...religious sort of thing with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.02,0:24:34.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.52,0:24:36.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你说的是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you are lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.10,0:24:43.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但纵然恶魔真得赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But even if the demons do win...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.91,0:24:51.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也不会有命见证了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...you won't be there to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.57,0:24:55.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该找水管工好好看看那些管子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should talk to your plumber about the pipes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.21,0:25:24.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还有很多东西要学呢  兔崽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a lot to learn,boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.11,0:25:27.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会再送你回学堂好好调教的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'll see you back in class,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.49,0:25:31.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就从周一上午  晨光初洒的那一刻开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bright and early,monday morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.33,0:25:41.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦  真够险的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.23,0:25:43.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来上帝是与我同在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like god is on my side today.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.79,0:26:17.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.33,0:26:19.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们天上来得家伙  就像小强一样难杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like roaches,you celestials.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.00,0:26:23.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真希望能知道该怎么灭了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really wish I knew how to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.54,0:26:28.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过至少我还知道要怎么把你送回你老家天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But all I can do is send you back to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.54,0:26:35.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Omnipotentis dei potestateminvoco.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.25,0:26:38.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Omnipotentis dei potestateminvoco.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.75,0:26:40.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Omnipotentis dei potestateminvoco.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.84,0:27:03.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,东施效颦的蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid pet tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.54,0:27:05.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟是谁杀了天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's murdering the angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.35,0:27:07.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是怎么办到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are they doing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.58,0:27:10.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真以为我会告诉你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think i'm gonna tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.31,0:27:13.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我很肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.05,0:27:18.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些恶魔到底是怎么杀死天使的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are the demons killing angels?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.29,0:27:22.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.15,0:27:25.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't...know!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.46,0:27:26.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.26,0:27:31.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我们干得\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's...not...us!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.96,0:27:35.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们  没干过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're...not doing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.47,0:27:37.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不信你你的鬼话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.91,0:27:44.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝  根本不会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith... is not behind this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.68,0:27:48.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她可不削只杀那么七个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wouldn't kill seven angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.05,0:27:52.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她要杀就会成百\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'd kill 100...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.35,0:27:56.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上千的猎杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}1,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.69,0:28:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.16,0:28:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不就是我送回去嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send me back...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.87,0:28:09.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也就那本事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.87,0:28:11.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在可不止那点儿本事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm stronger than that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.71,0:28:14.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以直让你魂飞魄散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I can kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.34,0:29:19.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  -到里面去把他治好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam. -get in there and heal him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.21,0:29:21.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-用神迹  快  -我办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Miracle now. - I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.68,0:29:24.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是你和尤利尔把他害成这样的  -不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You and Uriel put him in there! - no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.28,0:29:26.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你们竟然连一个小小的恶魔陷阱都维系不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you can't keep a simple devil's trap together.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.59,0:29:28.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道是怎么回事儿  那个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what happened. that trap --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.46,0:29:32.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能会出问题的  我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It shouldn't have broken. I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.23,0:29:34.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事从头到尾根本就是没事找事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole thing was pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.93,0:29:36.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你还想不明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.90,0:29:38.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那根本就不是恶魔干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demons aren't doing the hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.47,0:29:40.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是别的东西让你们损兵折将的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something else is killing your soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.57,0:29:42.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定是阿拉斯泰尔故弄玄虚呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps Alastair was lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.27,0:29:43.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.84,0:29:44.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.29,0:30:03.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是卡西迪奥吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.23,0:30:09.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚收到天使长传来的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I received revelation from our superiors.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.60,0:30:15.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的兄弟姐妹们正一个个地死去  他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our brothers and sisters are dying,and they --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.42,0:30:18.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们希望我们俩将猎杀恶魔的事暂时搁置\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want us to stop hunting the demon responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.51,0:30:28.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面似乎出了什么乱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something is wrong up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.28,0:30:30.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你感觉到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,can you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.42,0:30:34.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凶手  可能并不是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The murderers -- maybe they aren't demonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.29,0:30:36.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆·温彻斯特说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam winchester said
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.00,0:30:37.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔跟这个一点关系都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}the demons have nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.79,0:30:40.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是恶魔  那会是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not the demons,what could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.30,0:30:47.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天堂的意愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The will of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.70,0:30:48.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在失利  尤利尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are failing,uriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.97,0:30:50.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要打败仗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are losing the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.30,0:30:52.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能战地已经被处罚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps the garrison is being punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.61,0:30:54.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为我们的上帝会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think our father would --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.14,0:30:59.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得可能我们的上帝已经不再下达指令了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think maybe our father isn't giving the orders anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.21,0:31:02.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能出了什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe there is something wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.15,0:31:07.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我不想等着被消灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,i won't wait to be gutted.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.96,0:31:17.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.30,0:31:26.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜  拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna,please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.98,0:31:36.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最终还是决定杀了我么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decided to kill me after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.48,0:31:38.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.62,0:31:40.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想从我这得到什么  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want from me,castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.49,0:31:42.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在想着要不服从命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm considering disobedience.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.79,0:31:45.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.23,0:31:47.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.46,0:31:51.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the first time...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.30,0:31:53.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.87,0:31:55.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会越来越糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gets worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.54,0:32:00.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,选择你自己行动的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choosing your own course of action --
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.07,0:32:02.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确很让迷惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's confusing...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.74,0:32:04.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.38,0:32:13.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.12,0:32:14.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很好  用不上我的帮忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too good for my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.96,0:32:16.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是个垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trash...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.92,0:32:18.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是个活生生的亵渎上帝的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}A walking blasphemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.79,0:32:21.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.73,0:32:23.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.60,0:32:25.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托告诉我该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.47,0:32:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像以前一样么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the old days?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.27,0:32:32.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.24,0:32:34.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.84,0:32:36.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是时候你自己思考了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to think for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.59,0:33:29.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你找我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You called?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.16,0:33:31.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么说  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say,castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.36,0:33:34.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加入我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you join me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.10,0:33:35.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是跟我对战到底\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you fight with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.70,0:33:38.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.10,0:33:39.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange how...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.74,0:33:41.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一根漏水的管子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A leaky pipe
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.34,0:33:43.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就可以解除天使设的圈套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can undo the work of angels
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.71,0:33:46.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我们自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we ourselves...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.71,0:33:49.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本应该是命运的使者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are supppped to be the agents of fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.52,0:33:52.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿尔斯泰尔比我们想象得更厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alastair was much more powerful than we had imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.45,0:33:53.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.59,0:33:56.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有恶魔能逃脱那个圈套\N{\fnArial\fs30}No demon can overpower that trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.79,0:33:58.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.99,0:34:03.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们做了很久朋友了  尤利尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been friends for a long time,uriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.53,0:34:05.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并肩作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fought by each others' sides,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.73,0:34:07.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,远离家乡  一同服役\N{\fnArial\fs30}Served together away from home...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.84,0:34:12.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太久了  似乎是\N{\fnArial\fs30}...for what seems like...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.61,0:34:13.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.77,0:34:16.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是兄弟  尤利尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're brothers,uriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.04,0:34:19.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我这个面子  告诉我真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pay me that respect. tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.98,0:34:21.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真相是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.55,0:34:23.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唯一能杀死天使的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing that can kill an angel...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.76,0:34:31.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是另一个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}...is another angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.15,0:34:38.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.42,0:34:40.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid so.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.69,0:34:43.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你破了魔鬼圈套\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you broke the devil's trap,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.73,0:34:46.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把阿尔斯泰尔引到迪恩那去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set alastair on dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.90,0:34:49.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿尔斯泰尔就不该是活着被囚禁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alastair should never have been taken aliv
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.57,0:34:51.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很棘手  卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really inconvenient,cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.93,0:34:54.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我的确搞了点小破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,i did turn the screw a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.64,0:35:00.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿尔斯泰尔说不定已经杀了迪恩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alastair should' killed deanand,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.18,0:35:02.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且你也谋害了我们的亲属么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the murders of our kin?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.58,0:35:05.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是谋害  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not murders,castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.48,0:35:07.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.48,0:35:11.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的工作  就是转化\N{\fnArial\fs30}My work...is conversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.25,0:35:13.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这等了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have we waited here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.32,0:35:15.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们又根据这些毫无意义的规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have we played this game
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.39,0:35:17.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玩这游戏玩了多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By rules that make no sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.63,0:35:19.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们父亲的世界  尤利尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is our father's world,uriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.66,0:35:22.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our father?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.16,0:35:24.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经不是了  要是他真的曾是我们的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stopped being that,if he ever was,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.73,0:35:26.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他创造我们的这些的那一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}The moment he created them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.70,0:35:28.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.50,0:35:31.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}His favorites.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.37,0:35:34.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的牢骚  他恶心的幼虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}His whining,puking larvae.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.78,0:35:36.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也要转化我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you trying to convert me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.65,0:35:39.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你能加入我  我还是这么希望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted you to join me,and i still do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.58,0:35:41.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有了你  我们就足够强悍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}With you,we can be powerful enough to --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.68,0:35:42.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}to?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.79,0:35:44.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,净化我们的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}to raise our brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.15,0:35:47.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.19,0:35:48.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定记得他\N{\fnArial\fs30}you do remember him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.70,0:35:56.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他曾经那么强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}how strong he was...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.30,0:35:58.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么的美丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}how beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.00,0:36:01.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他没有向人类卑躬屈膝\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he didn't bow to humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.67,0:36:04.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他为了维护我们而被惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was punished for defending us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.31,0:36:06.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如要你想要去相信什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}now,if you want to believe in something,cass,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.44,0:36:07.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他作为你的信仰吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}believe in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.61,0:36:09.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路西法不是上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer is not god.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.61,0:36:12.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝不再是上帝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}god isn't god anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.78,0:36:14.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他对我们不管不顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}he doesn't care what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.88,0:36:17.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我就是最好的证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}i am proof of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.25,0:36:18.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.23,0:36:24.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要做什么 尤利尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}what were you gonna do,uriel?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.96,0:36:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想杀了所有的精英么\N{\fnArial\fs30}were you gonna kill the whole garrison?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.26,0:36:30.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只把那个说不的给杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}i only killed the ones who said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.77,0:36:34.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他人都已经加入我们了 卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}others have joined me,cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.04,0:36:39.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟  说真的  不要与我为敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}now,please,brother. don't fight me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.14,0:36:40.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮助我\N{\fnArial\fs30}help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.08,0:36:44.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮助我把话传出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}help me spread the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.65,0:36:47.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我一起召唤天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}help me bring on this apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.59,0:36:52.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你所要做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}all you have to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.96,0:36:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是勇敢些\N{\fnArial\fs30}is be unafraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.00,0:37:05.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么久以来  这还是第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the first time in a long time...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.21,0:37:10.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的无所畏惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}...i am.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.61,0:37:47.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤利尔  你是赢不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't win,uriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.78,0:37:49.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是侍奉上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}i still serve god.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.81,0:37:51.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都没有见过上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}you haven't even met the man!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.72,0:37:55.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is no will!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.65,0:37:59.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}no wrath!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.66,0:38:04.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}no...god.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.10,0:38:11.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe or maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.24,0:38:14.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是还有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's still me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.00,0:38:54.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.70,0:39:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算没事也不是因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}no thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.84,0:39:08.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要加倍小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}you need to be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.81,0:39:12.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要好好学下怎么困住恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}you need to learn how to manage a damn devil's trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.82,0:39:14.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是那个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's not what i mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.95,0:39:18.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤利尔死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}uriel is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.49,0:39:21.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔杀了他?\N{\fnArial\fs30}was it the demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.83,0:39:23.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为抗命\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was disobedience.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.33,0:39:28.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他跟我们对着干\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was working against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.84,0:39:35.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.94,0:39:40.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我破坏了第一个封印吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}did i break the first seal?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.61,0:39:44.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我导致了这一切吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}did i start all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.75,0:39:48.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.32,0:39:53.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当发现莉莉丝对你实施的计划时\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we discovered lilith's plan for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.79,0:39:58.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把地狱包围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...we laid siege to hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.30,0:40:01.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想用自己的方式找到你  在你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we fought our way to get to you before you --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.43,0:40:03.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开启天启之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}jump-started the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.90,0:40:07.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是为时已晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we were too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.07,0:40:11.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不直接把我留在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}why didn't you just leave me there,then?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.04,0:40:16.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是责怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not...blame that falls on you,dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.45,0:40:19.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是命运的安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.25,0:40:28.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开启这一切的义人(宗教用语)\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the righteous man who begins it
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.13,0:40:30.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是唯一能阻止这一切的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the only one who can finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.63,0:40:36.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须阻止它\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.14,0:40:40.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路西法?\N{\fnArial\fs30}lucifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.34,0:40:44.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天启?\N{\fnArial\fs30}the apocalypse?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.38,0:40:50.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.12,0:40:59.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这狗娘养的  别再从我面前消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't you go disappearing on me,you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.89,0:41:00.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.06,0:41:02.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}i don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.26,0:41:03.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扯淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}bull!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.16,0:41:04.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}i don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.60,0:41:09.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  他们不会和我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}dean,they don't tell me much.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.73,0:41:12.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}i know...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.20,0:41:15.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还有多少信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}how our fate rests with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.41,0:41:19.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子  你们完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}well,then,you guys are screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.64,0:41:22.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}i can't do it,cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.01,0:41:25.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太沉重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's too big.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.25,0:41:26.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿拉斯泰尔没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}alastair was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.02,0:41:28.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不再是完整的我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm not all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.22,0:41:31.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不够强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm not -- i'm not strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.26,0:41:41.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}well,i guess i'm not the man
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.73,0:41:43.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是我爸爸想我成为的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}either of our dads wanted me to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.61,0:41:50.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找别人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}find someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.18,0:41:54.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
